@page "/when-the-storm-hits"
<PageTitle>When the storm hits · Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <h1 class="ta-page-headline">When the storm hits</h1>
    <p class="ta-storm-idea">Turn it down. Don’t turn it off.</p>
    <p class="ta-page-sub">When the weather turns, nobody rips out the furnace. You adjust the thermostat. Most investors put off the decision because selling a winner is hard, and then they overreact. Tangent Atlas gives your money a thermostat. If you want to take some heat off, turn it down a few degrees and the whole house cools together. Your mix stays your mix, and your favorites keep their place.</p>
</div>

<section class="ta-storm-band">
    <div class="ta-container ta-storm-grid">
        <div class="ta-storm-dial">
            <svg width="240" height="240" viewBox="0 0 240 240" role="img" aria-label="A round thermostat turned down from 100% invested to 80% invested">
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="112" fill="#ffffff" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.12)" stroke-width="2"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="433.5 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="92" fill="none" stroke="#1D9E75" stroke-width="14" stroke-dasharray="346.8 578" transform="rotate(135 120 120)" stroke-linecap="round"></circle>
                <circle cx="120" cy="120" r="70" fill="#f9f9f7"></circle>
                <text x="120" y="122" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Playfair Display, Georgia, serif" font-size="44" fill="#1a1a1a">80%</text>
                <text x="120" y="148" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="13" fill="#4b5563">invested</text>
                <text x="120" y="168" text-anchor="middle" font-family="DM Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="500" fill="#0F6E56">▼ from 100%</text>
            </svg>
            <div class="ta-storm-dial-caption">You set the temperature.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-storm-bars">
            <div class="ta-storm-row">
                <div class="ta-storm-label">Before: $500,000 invested</div>
                <div class="ta-storm-bar" role="img" aria-label="Before: your favorite 30%, your second favorite 20%, an index fund 40%, everything else 10%">
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-1" style="width: 30%">$150k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-2" style="width: 20%">$100k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-3" style="width: 40%">$200k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-4" style="width: 10%">$50k</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ta-storm-row">
                <div class="ta-storm-label">After: $400,000 invested, $100,000 in cash</div>
                <div class="ta-storm-bar" role="img" aria-label="After: each holding 20% smaller, the same mix, and $100,000 in cash">
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-1" style="width: 24%">$120k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-2" style="width: 16%">$80k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-3" style="width: 32%">$160k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-4" style="width: 8%">$40k</div>
                    <div class="ta-seg ta-seg-cash" style="width: 20%">Cash $100k</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ta-legend">
                <span><span class="ta-swatch ta-seg-1"></span>Your favorite</span>
                <span><span class="ta-swatch ta-seg-2"></span>Your second favorite</span>
                <span><span class="ta-swatch ta-seg-3"></span>An index fund</span>
                <span><span class="ta-swatch ta-seg-4"></span>Everything else</span>
            </div>
            <p class="ta-storm-note">The whole house cools together, not one room. Every holding is 20% smaller, and the mix inside is exactly what it was: your favorite is still 30% of what you hold, your index fund still 40%.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="ta-container ta-page">
    <ol class="ta-steps">
        <li class="ta-step">
            <div class="ta-step-num">1</div>
            <div class="ta-step-title">Turn the thermostat</div>
            <div class="ta-step-body">One decision, in calm or in a storm: how much you want invested.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="ta-step">
            <div class="ta-step-num">2</div>
            <div class="ta-step-title">The whole house adjusts</div>
            <div class="ta-step-body">Across every holding and every account, in whole shares, by a published rule you choose. Nothing is dumped in a hurry.</div>
        </li>
        <li class="ta-step">
            <div class="ta-step-num">3</div>
            <div class="ta-step-title">Turn it back up when you’re ready</div>
            <div class="ta-step-body">You approve every change before it goes to your own broker, with a record of what was sold and why. Turning it up works the same way.</div>
        </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="ta-storm-close">Respond with discipline, not panic.</p></div>
